cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the calibration data, please cite it as below."
title: "nOdes: a human-carried proximity swarm"
abstract: >-
  nOdes is a swarm of handheld wireless orbs that sense who is with whom in a room
  by inter-node Wi-Fi signal strength, cluster on it, and play that configuration
  back to the people holding them as collective light and sound. This repository is
  a curated replication kit: firmware, the central plane, the visualisers, the sound
  layer, every experiment driver, and the calibration data behind the published
  characterisation.
